WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:08.700
One of the promises I made when I started
this show was I would personally acknowledge

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.530
legitimate criticism when it's thrown my way.

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:15.309
This acknowledgment is one of the reasons
I do live Q&amp;A's right here on YouTube, as

00:00:15.309 --> 00:00:19.960
well as on Twitter, Facebook, and even when
people come up to me on the street.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.430
Not only do I genuinely like hearing from
you directly, but I think it's also important

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:26.430
to hear the bad feedback right along with
the good.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:31.369
Note I said legit criticism, and not hysterical
troll criticism.

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:34.649
For example, I'm happy to hear from people
who want me to ask questions differently,

00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:39.000
or to have more aggressive follow ups or to
find alternative guests, or anything along

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.390
those lines.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:44.650
Those qualify as legit criticism whether or
not I agree.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:49.520
The people who just tell me that I'm a straight
white supremcaist neo nazi alt right racist,

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:53.290
well let's just say I'm less likely to engage
with you.

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:57.580
The battle of ideas is far more interesting
to me than the battle to be first to sarcastically

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.750
respond to a tweet.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:06.220
One criticism I hear occasionally is I'm actually
not a liberal, and I'm really a secret conservative.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:11.400
Or, sometimes they'll say I'm the only thing
worse than a conservative: a dreaded right

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:12.400
winger.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:17.200
Now it is true, I've been saying for months
that defending my liberal principles, is now

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.500
a conservative position.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:20.680
But am I still a liberal?

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:25.140
Do I still believe in any of thing things
that people on the left believe?

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.820
Since we have so many new subscribers around
here I thought I'd lay out some of my liberal

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.700
cred for you, in case you missed it...

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.780
I'm so for gay marriage, I even married a
guy!

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:39.070
I'm pro-choice, I'm against the death penalty,
I'm for a social safety net.

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:44.220
I'm for a strong public education system,
I'm for legalizing marijuana, I'm for reforming

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:49.240
our prison system, and I'm against unnecessary
wars and nation building.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:52.390
There's other stuff too, but I think I've
made my point.

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:58.150
Beyond any of those specific issues though,
I'm for true tolerance of opinion and thought.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:02.310
My liberalism is one of a live and let live
attitude.

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:05.009
This is where I diverge from the modern left.

00:02:05.009 --> 00:02:09.660
I see virtually no diversity of thought or
tolerance of other opinions on the Left of

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:13.860
today, just constant smearing and slandering
of all intellectual opponents.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:18.050
Take a step back for a moment and think about
your friends on the Left.

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:23.450
Are they tolerant of people who aren't for
gay marriage, or of people who are pro choice?

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:28.920
These used to be political differences, now
they are somehow a referendum on what type

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:33.180
of person you are, and whether you can be
in someone's life.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:38.569
I wish this intolerance was an isolated case,
but not only have I seen this type of intolerance

00:02:38.569 --> 00:02:42.780
first hand, but I hear it from you guys every
single day.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:47.280
I get emails about marriages breaking up,
life long friends no longer talking to each

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:52.209
other and people afraid to say what they think
politically because of repercussions it will

00:02:52.209 --> 00:02:53.209
have at work.

00:02:53.209 --> 00:02:54.989
And by the way, now I'll reverse that.

00:02:54.989 --> 00:02:59.820
Do you know people on the right who are tolerant
of people who are for gay marriage and who

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.020
are pro life?

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:05.540
I actually do, plenty of them, including people
who I've had on this show.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:11.240
When there is a disagreement, I see way more
people on the right, conservatives or libertarians,

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:17.440
more often willing to agree to disagree attitude
rather than defriending or smearing?

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.610
Could the right be better?

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.730
Are there real bigots on the right?

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:21.730
Absolutely.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.160
Are there real racists on the right?

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:29.940
Without question, but by and large these aren't
the voices from the mainstream right anymore.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:34.580
Let's not forget, even Donald Trump got a
standing ovation at the Republican National

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:38.800
Convention when he talked about protecting
LGBTQ rights.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:44.030
Of course all this said, doesn't mean things
are all right with the right right now.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:48.130
Just in the last few weeks Tomi Lahren was
let go by The Blaze after she came out as

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:53.170
being pro-choice Or at the very least giving
a conservative explanation for abortion by

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:56.830
saying the government should stay out of a
women's private life.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:02.209
I actually agree with her rationalization
here and know that position upsets a lot of

00:04:02.209 --> 00:04:03.209
Conservatives.

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:07.980
The immediate reaction to her comments and
her subsequent firing strike me as the intolerance

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:11.540
we're used to seeing from the Left these days,
not the Right.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:15.819
And for the record, I'd I've invited Tomi
on the show, and Glenn Beck back on the show

00:04:15.819 --> 00:04:18.959
to discuss what went down between them.

00:04:18.959 --> 00:04:25.219
I happen to like them both and we all have
views that are inconsistent with our broader

00:04:25.219 --> 00:04:26.490
ideologies.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.039
We're not not robots yet, we're still human.

00:04:29.039 --> 00:04:35.389
Oh, and yes, by the way it is Glenn's right
as a private businessman to hire and fire

00:04:35.389 --> 00:04:41.949
people as he sees fit, even if I don't agree
with the reason why he did it.

00:04:41.949 --> 00:04:46.110
Another area which I don't fit into the traditional
political box is gun control.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:50.759
I absolutely believe in the 2nd amendment
and obviously also believe that a healthy

00:04:50.759 --> 00:04:55.689
distrust of the government is an important
part of being American.

00:04:55.689 --> 00:04:59.479
Democrats often make it sounds like Republicans
want every American wandering the streets

00:04:59.479 --> 00:05:03.800
with a weapon like we're in the wild west
and Republicans often make it sound like every

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:07.389
Democrat wants to take away their right to
self defense.

00:05:07.389 --> 00:05:12.550
As for me, I believe we have the right to
bare arms but also have to keep weapons out

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:17.559
of the hands of the wrong people, and perhaps
even more importantly, have a discussion about

00:05:17.559 --> 00:05:21.970
mental health, which usually has more to do
with these shootings than just the weapon

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.369
itself.

00:05:23.369 --> 00:05:24.369
As always.

00:05:24.369 --> 00:05:27.439
I'll keep talking about free speech, free
expression, and the rights of the individual

00:05:27.439 --> 00:05:31.889
which I believe to be the most important facet
of a truly free society.

00:05:31.889 --> 00:05:36.830
Whether that makes me a Libtard or a Cuckservative
or a right wing maniac is for the commenters

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:37.439
to decide.

